# "Each opponent loses 4 life unless that player sacrifices a nonland permanent of their choice or discards a card": a
# permanent that can't be sacrificed is nothing to sacrifice (CR 101.2, 118.3). Bot2 mulligans to Hithlain Rope alone and
# puts it onto the battlefield with Bot1's Show and Tell, which puts Rottenmouth Viper onto Bot1's. For the Viper's blight
# counter Bot2 has a nonland permanent but can't sacrifice it, and no card in hand: it is asked nothing and loses 4 life.

[Opening]
Chooser: Bot1

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Rottenmouth Viper
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Hithlain Rope
Island x30

